The dataset in data/MX_Dengue_trends.csv is redistributed from the MIGHTE-lab
SISMID teaching repositories (https://github.com/MIGHTE-lab/SISMID25).

The ARGO method reproduced in notebooks/01_research_dengue.ipynb is described in:
  Yang S, Santillana M, Kou SC. "Accurate estimation of influenza epidemics using
  Google search data via ARGO." PNAS 112(47):14473-14478, 2015.
